<div class="well">
<h4>News</h4>


May 14, 2026
<p>Enrico Gallinucci has been elected Vice Chair of the Steering Committee of <a href='https://dolapworkshop.github.io/steering-committee'>DOLAP</a>, the premier workshop of the international scientific community in the field of data management for analytics and AI processing.</p>

March 01, 2026
<p>Matteo Francia is now Researcher in Tenure Track at the Department of Computer Science and Engineering.</p>

September 01, 2025
<p>Enrico Gallinucci is Chair of the 2nd <a href='https://adbis26.sciencesconf.org/resource/page/id/16'>Doctoral Consortium School</a> of <a href='https://adbis26.sciencesconf.org/?lang=en'>ADBIS 2026</a>, to be held on September 2026 in Orléans, France.</p>

March 25, 2025
<p>Happy to announce that Enrico Gallinucci and Matteo Golfarelli received the Best Paper Award@DOLAP 2025 with the paper <a href='https://ceur-ws.org/Vol-3931/paper1.pdf'>'Impact Study of NoSQL Refactoring in SkyServer Database'</a></p>

Oct 31, 2024
<p>Our patented <i>Method and System for Monitoring Soil Moisture</i> has been one of the selected finalists of the <a href='https://magazine.unibo.it/archivio/2024/10/31/luniversita-di-bologna-premiata-agli-intellectual-property-award'>Intellectual Property Award 2024</a>.</p>

September 01, 2024
<p>Enrico Gallinucci is Chair of the 1st <a href='https://adbis2025.github.io/Calls/doctoral-consortium-school.html'>Doctoral Consortium School</a> of <a href='https://adbis2025.github.io/'>ADBIS 2025</a>, to be held on September 2025 in Tampere, Finland.</p>

May 01, 2024
<p>A warm welcome to Alex Baiardi, who joined the BIG team as a research fellow!</p>

February 08, 2024
<p>Enrico Gallinucci is now Researcher in Tenure Track at the Department of Computer Science and Engineering.</p>

October 18, 2023
<p>We have patented a <a href='https://www.uibm.gov.it/bancadati/single_search/text_search/index/'>Method and System for Monitoring Soil Moisture</a> (METODO E SISTEMA PER IL MONITORAGGIO DELL’UMIDITÀ DEL SUOLO).</p>


